    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d246">

                <pb facs="0319" n="235" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg235"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ehrman to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-11"><hi rendition="#italic">November 11,
                        1903</hi>.</date><lb/>(Received 5.32 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am officially informed that Bunau-Varilla is the authorized party to make
                    treaties. Boyd and Amador have other missions and to assist their minister.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ehrman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
